+  //   clearing: +chargeNaira (retry in) −feeCharge (retry fee out) but no extra settle payout
+  //             = chargeNaira×(1−0.015) = chargeNaira×0.985 stranded
+  //   platform_fees: +feeCharge (retry charge-time fee)
+  //   merchant: unchanged (settle runs once, payout unchanged)
+  if (isRetry) {
